  {
    "id": "06d2fe83f8f7c1e0",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "a2bfb7e7c7a00101",
    "name": "Requires node-red-contrib-modbus. Simulator: 127.0.0.1:1502",
    "info": "Run the simulator first, then deploy this flow.\n\nUnit 1 — FC3 holding registers, address 0, quantity 3 (Current L1-L3, scale 100 → A)\nUnit 2 — FC4 input registers, address 0, quantity 1 (Current, scale 100 → A)\nUnit 3 — FC4 input 0x0000–0x0007 (Analog data, μA/mV) + FC3/FC6 holding 0x1000–0x1007 (Mode config)\n\nFor Unit 3: add a Slave device with Unit ID 3 in the simulator UI, then open the Analog tab and add channels.",
    "x": 300,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
